Yep. I've had it take thirty and more searches to
reveal a secret door.

And by the way, don't just search at the end of the
hallway; it is possible, but rare, for a hidden cell
to occur somewhere along the length of the
passageway, including quite likely one downward from
the first cell outside the room.

It is, by the way, possible to starve to death
before getting lucky on a search, so being in good
with your deity so you can pray successfully might
be a good reason to go back to level one and kill
something once in a while.

By the way three: while you are searching, monsters
are being created at the usual rate, so be ready for
a big fight once you do find the secret door or
hidden passage, and pay attention to your HPs.

